---
import Platform from '../layouts/Platform.astro';
---
<Platform title="About" description="Discover independent projects, meet their makers, and share your work on Digivated.">
  <header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT DIGIVATED</p><h1>Good work deserves to be found.</h1><p class="lede">Digivated connects curious people with independent projects, useful tools, and the people building them.</p></header>
  <div class="about-copy">
    <div class="about-values">
      <div><h2>Discover a project.</h2><p>Browse the directory, choose a category, or explore the featured collection. Open a project to meet its maker and visit the original website.</p></div>
      <div><h2>Help good work stand out.</h2><p>Leave feedback and upvote projects you find useful. Rankings show community upvotes across daily, weekly, monthly, and all-time periods.</p></div>
      <div><h2>Find your next resource.</h2><p>Browse useful sites by category, or keep interesting projects in your private browser collections.</p></div>
      <div><h2>Share what you’re building.</h2><p>Create a free account to submit a project and follow its review. Submission status and review-team feedback stay in your account.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p>Directory review is free. Projects are reviewed before publication, and selected projects may be featured or reposted by Digivated. Submitting does not guarantee a feature or repost.</p>
    <p><a href="/membership">Digivated Membership</a> costs $5 USD once and includes one reviewed project spotlight and full member News summaries. Previous purchases and free toolkit samples remain available.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/discover">Explore projects</a><a class="button" href="/submit-project">Submit a project</a></div>
  </div>
</Platform>
